h causes unit-tests to fail because the annotation `@TestSecurity(user = \"myuser\")` does not work any more. `SecurityContext.getUserPrincipal()` returns `null`.\r\n\r\nIf setting `quarkus.http.auth.proactive=true` the unit-tests works fine.\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nThe annotation `@TestSecurity(user = \"myuser\")` works in combination with `quarkus.http.auth.proactive=false`\r\n\r\n**Actual behavior**\r\n`@TestSecurity(user = \"myuser\")` in combination with `quarkus.http.auth.proactive=false` causes `SecurityContext.getUserPrincipal()` returns `null`.\r\n\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\n\r\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:\r\n1. Quarkus project with JAX-RS Rest-Endpoint and OIDC\r\n2. Protected endpoint (with `@Authenticated`) uses `SecurityContext.getUserPrincipal()` \r\n3. Unit-Test tests the endpoint using the annotation `@TestSecurity(user = \"myuser\")`\r\n\r\n**Environment (please complete the following information):**\r\n - Quarkus version or git rev: 1.9.0.Final\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"sberyozkin","id":467639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NzYzOQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/467639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sberyozkin","html_url":"https://github.com/sberyozkin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sberyozkin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sberyozkin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sberyozkin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sberyozkin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sberyozkin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sberyozkin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sberyozkin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sberyozkin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sberyozkin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.